        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 Sneaky and squeaky low-poly mice face off against a lone cat in the battlefield of a human house. Mice use proximity chat to communicate with other players, while the cat hunts their noises. Will the mice perform enough tasks to destroy the house, or will the cat defeat enough mice to save it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Faction of Chaos - The Mice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/31a90466bc59b32dc46cc7f15ec7a972.poster.avif?t=1781286851\" width=414 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/31a90466bc59b32dc46cc7f15ec7a972.webm?t=1781286851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win condition: Complete enough standard tasks, then complete both final tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform tasks that ruin the household just for the love of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat cheese to get a temporary speed boost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump up small obstacles and utilize mouse tunnels to navigate the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate or spout nonsense with other mice utilizing proximity chat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sole Defender of The House - The Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/7245a0bebe6436026a0a59423957cf91.poster.avif?t=1781286851\" width=658 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/7245a0bebe6436026a0a59423957cf91.webm?t=1781286851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win condition: Bring down the lives of the mouse team to 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack mice by pouncing or pawing them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your superior movement with faster speed, a bigger jump, and a pounce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track mice by audio cues and their trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep to revitalize, as energy drops throughout the game. Energy determines whether the cat moves fast or slow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a house that boasts a lot of verticality and tricks, will the little rascals come on top, or will the cat prevail?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made as a Senior Capstone project for RPI's Games and Simulation Arts and Sciences program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 Sneaky and squeaky low-poly mice face off against a lone cat in the battlefield of a human house. Mice use proximity chat to communicate with other players, while the cat hunts their noises. Will the mice perform enough tasks to destroy the house, or will the cat defeat enough mice to save it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Faction of Chaos - The Mice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/31a90466bc59b32dc46cc7f15ec7a972.poster.avif?t=1781286851\" width=414 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/31a90466bc59b32dc46cc7f15ec7a972.webm?t=1781286851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win condition: Complete enough standard tasks, then complete both final tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform tasks that ruin the household just for the love of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat cheese to get a temporary speed boost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump up small obstacles and utilize mouse tunnels to navigate the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate or spout nonsense with other mice utilizing proximity chat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sole Defender of The House - The Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/7245a0bebe6436026a0a59423957cf91.poster.avif?t=1781286851\" width=658 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149620/extras/7245a0bebe6436026a0a59423957cf91.webm?t=1781286851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win condition: Bring down the lives of the mouse team to 0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack mice by pouncing or pawing them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your superior movement with faster speed, a bigger jump, and a pounce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track mice by audio cues and their trails.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep to revitalize, as energy drops throughout the game. Energy determines whether the cat moves fast or slow.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a house that boasts a lot of verticality and tricks, will the little rascals come on top, or will the cat prevail?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made as a Senior Capstone project for RPI's Games and Simulation Arts and Sciences program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
